  <Index>k__BackingField: 16
  <Title>k__BackingField: Green Hell
  <Settings>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a4621c90bf8b4fb4f8d530d842f8c4a0, type: 2}
  description: The Verdant Delta's jungle hides the Shadow's airfields. Follow the roads and rivers north and meet the Twin Rotor, a flying gun platform.
  introduces: Interceptors climb from behind you with a warning. Phase shields absorb damage first.
  hints:
  - 'An interceptor warning at the bottom edge means: move aside.'
  - Take the Twin Rotor's cannons first; its hull is armoured until they fall.
